    "title": "Castle Solitaire: Card Game",
    "description": "Meet your new addiction! \r\nBreak out of your boredom cell and cash in on the fun with Castle Solitaire card games!\r\n\r\nCastle Solitaire is a fun and free Solitaire card game from MobilityWare, the maker of all your favorite solitaire card games. In this fast and easy to learn game, you can clash with kings, crush your enemies, build your castles, and fly your banner high!\r\n\r\n== How to Play ==\r\nTo become a Castle Solitaire champion, fill the four castles from Ace to King. Tap to arrange cards of the same suit in descending order below the castles. If you get stuck, smash the stockpile to reveal more cards to use. Castle Solitaire is similar to Vanishing Cross or King\u2019s Corner, but with it\u2019s own special twist.\r\n\r\n== Features ==\r\n\u2660 Crush through challenging levels and earn new titles from Serf up to Town Crier and beyond!\r\n\u2660 Customize your experience with different backgrounds and cards. You can even use one of your own photos as the background!\r\n\u2660 Become a Solitaire winner and celebrate with exciting winning animations!\r\n\u2660 Play offline on your own free time\r\n\u2660 Cash in on your skills and collect badge rewards during weekly special events\r\n\r\n== More Fun Card Games from MobilityWare ==\r\n\u2663 Solitaire, also known as Klondike or Patience\r\n\u2663 Spider Solitaire\r\n\u2663 Freecell\r\n\u2663 Pyramid Solitaire\r\n\u2663 Crown Solitaire\r\n\u2663 Tripeaks Solitaire\r\n\u2663 Spider Go Solitaire\r\n\u2663 Monopoly Solitaire\r\n\r\nRelax and free your mind with this one of a kind free solitaire card game. Castle Solitaire introduces a clash of strategy and leisure. Smash through competitor stats, crush your high score, build your castles, and conquer with flair!\r\n\r\nIt's an addiction you won't want to break.\r\n\r\nLIKE US on Facebook\r\nhttp://www.facebook.com/mobilitywaresolitaire\r\n\r\nQuestions? Comments? Concerns? We would love to hear from you! Reach us at \r\nhttp://www.mobilityware.com/support.php\r\n\r\nCastle Solitaire is created and supported by MobilityWare.",
